  "body": "The camcraft-mcp skill (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`) tool table doesn't list the operation-order tools added by PR #959 (#45): `rename_operation {name, new_name}` and `reorder_operation {name, target, place}`. Agents driving CamCraft from the skill won't know they exist (the live registry `tools::list()` does).\n\nIt's a process file, so the fix is its own small PR with a `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` bump. It waits for PR #959 to merge (a feat, at the next cut) so the table never names tools main doesn't have.\n\nDone means: both tools appear in the skill's tool table with their parameters and undo note; PROCESS_VERSION bumped; #681 announced on merge.\n",
